OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain moving
OL,6,Fnorth to Shetland, mostly light and
OL,7,Fclearing all areas later in the
OL,8,Fevening, Brisk westerly winds
OL,9,Fcontinuing through the night with
OL,10,Foccasional showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA blustery day with frequent
OL,13,Fshowers moving through with the strong
OL,14,Fsouthwesterly winds, winds touching
OL,15,Fgales in the afternoon.
